<li><a href="../references/index.html" data-zh="📚 參考資料" data-en="📚 References">📚 參考資料</a></li>
</ul>
</div></nav>

<div class="quiz-wrap">
  <div class="quiz-header">
    <h1>📊 <span data-zh="生物統計 互動式考題" data-en="Biostatistics Interactive Quiz">生物統計 互動式考題</span></h1>
    <p data-lang="zh">涵蓋 13 章生物統計核心主題的單選、多選、是非題，內建錯題複習、隨機練習與多使用者進度。</p>
    <p data-lang="en">Single-choice, multi-select, and true/false questions across 13 biostatistics chapters — with wrong-answer review, random practice, and multi-user progress tracking.</p>
  </div>

  <div class="coming-soon">
    <h2 data-zh="📝 題庫建置中" data-en="📝 Quiz bank under construction">📝 題庫建置中</h2>
    <p data-lang="zh">題庫正在建置中，預計每章 10 題、共約 130 題雙語題庫。在題庫完成前，請先閱讀各章節並參考 <a href="../references/index.html">參考資料頁</a> 的引用文獻與教學註記。</p>
    <p data-lang="en">The question bank is under construction — ~10 questions per chapter, ~130 bilingual questions total. While we build it, please work through the chapters and consult the cited papers and tutorial notes on the <a href="../references/index.html">References page</a>.</p>

    <div class="topic-grid">
      <div data-zh="Step 1 描述統計" data-en="Step 1 Descriptive">Step 1 描述統計</div>
      <div data-zh="Step 2 機率分布" data-en="Step 2 Distributions">Step 2 機率分布</div>
      <div data-zh="Step 3 抽樣 & CLT" data-en="Step 3 Sampling & CLT">Step 3 抽樣 & CLT</div>
      <div data-zh="Step 4 假設檢定" data-en="Step 4 Hypothesis">Step 4 假設檢定</div>
      <div data-zh="Step 5 t 檢定" data-en="Step 5 t-tests">Step 5 t 檢定</div>
      <div data-zh="Step 6 卡方檢定" data-en="Step 6 Chi-square">Step 6 卡方檢定</div>
      <div data-zh="Step 7 ANOVA" data-en="Step 7 ANOVA">Step 7 ANOVA</div>
      <div data-zh="Step 8 線性迴歸" data-en="Step 8 Linear Reg.">Step 8 線性迴歸</div>
      <div data-zh="Step 9 邏輯斯迴歸" data-en="Step 9 Logistic">Step 9 邏輯斯迴歸</div>
      <div data-zh="Step 10 存活分析" data-en="Step 10 Survival">Step 10 存活分析</div>
      <div data-zh="Step 11 樣本數 & Power" data-en="Step 11 Power">Step 11 樣本數 & Power</div>
      <div data-zh="Step 12 多重檢定 / FDR" data-en="Step 12 FDR">Step 12 FDR</div>
      <div data-zh="Step 13 混合模型" data-en="Step 13 Mixed Models">Step 13 混合模型</div>
    </div>

    <p style="margin-top:24px"><a href="../index.html" data-zh="← 回教學首頁" data-en="← Back to tutorial home">← 回教學首頁</a></p>
  </div>
</div>

